Wed Nov 18 08:15:45 UTC 2026 - Peter Simons <psimons@suse.com>

- Update crypton-x509-store to version 1.10.1.
  ## 1.10.1

  `TRUSTED CERTIFICATE` PEM blocks are no longer used as trust anchors,
  and several CAs with the same subject are kept.

  * Fix trust store loading
    [#38](https://github.com/kazu-yamamoto/crypton-certificate/pull/38)
  * Build certification paths with backtracking and implement CRL distribution points
    [#48](https://github.com/kazu-yamamoto/crypton-certificate/pull/48)
  * Read store files strictly with cloexec
    [#49](https://github.com/kazu-yamamoto/crypton-certificate/pull/49)

  ## 1.10.0

  * Read ML-DSA private keys
    [#35](https://github.com/kazu-yamamoto/crypton-certificate/pull/35)
  * Follow the breaking change in `crypton-x509` 1.10.0
    [#35](https://github.com/kazu-yamamoto/crypton-certificate/pull/35)

